Theorem data_classification : forall text, classify (Native.Ok text) = 1.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.
Theorem eof_classification : classify (Native.Error (Native.Ok tt)) = 2.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.
Theorem error_classification : forall text, classify (Native.Error (Native.Error text)) = 3.
Proof. reflexivity. Qed.
